<p class="Use"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span> <span class="Command">Average Noise Reduction</span> <span lang="EN-GB">to remove any small imperfections in the isolated data regions. Poor surface finish, direct reflections or using incorrect laser power setting may cause noise in the data.</span></p>
